Subject: [PATCH v3 13/25] drm/sun4i: sun6i_mipi_dsi: Fix DSI hfp timing value
In-Reply-To: <20181026144344.27778-1-jagan@amarulasolutions.com>
References: <20181026144344.27778-1-jagan@amarulasolutions.com>
